    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="5">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 5</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be freolsdægum ⁊ fæstenum.] [Ld] ⁊ healde man ælces Sunnandæges freolsunga fram Sæternesdæges nontide oð Monandæges lihtinge, be þam wite ðe seo domboc tæce, ⁊ ælcne oðerne mæssedæg swa he beboden sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every Sunday shall be observed as a festival from noonday on Saturday until dawn on Monday, under pain of the penalty which the written law prescribes; and every other feast-day according to the regulations appointed for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ healde man ælces Sunnandæges freols fram nóntide þæs Sæternesdæges oð ðæs Monandæges lihtinge, be þam wite, þe domboc tæcð, ⁊ ælcne oðerne mæssedæg swa he bebodan beo.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
